# Integration tests

## Marker

- Decorate DB-dependent tests with `@pytest.mark.integration`.
- They auto-skip when `AIRFLOW_CONN_NASCAR_CONN` is unset ([`tests/conftest.py`](../../tests/conftest.py)).

## When to use

- Prefer SQL **contract** tests (`test_cup_importer_sql_contract.py`) for importer clause/dependency changes.
- Reserve runtime integration tests for true end-to-end behavior against MariaDB.

## Run

```bash
uv run pytest -o addopts='' -m integration
```

Only run when a live connection is configured. Do not require integration tests to pass in environments without `AIRFLOW_CONN_NASCAR_CONN`.

See [`AGENTS.md`](../../AGENTS.md) for full validation expectations.
